      "text": "Trade Marks Act 1995 Part 13 Importation of goods infringing Australian trade marks Trade Marks Regulations 1995 Part 13 Importation of goods infringing Australian trade marks"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Holders of a protected international trade mark can object to the importation of goods which infringe their trade mark by giving a notice to the Australian Customs Service."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "For further information the Australian Border Force can be contacted: https://www.abf.gov.au/help-and-support/contact-us/telephone."
        }
      ],
